<!--
  The status-bar mark: a pawn, as one connected silhouette.

  The system keeps only the alpha channel of a small icon and re-tints it to match the shade, so
  colour, strokes and gradients are all discarded — which is why the launcher icon cannot be
  reused here and why this is a single flat fill.

  It was three separate shapes to begin with: a head, a collar and a base, with the gaps between
  them carrying the drawing. At twenty-four pixels those gaps close and it reads as a lump with
  two dashes under it. One outline instead, with the waist and the flare of the skirt doing the
  work — the negative space is outside the shape now rather than inside it, which is the only
  kind that survives being shrunk to the height of a status bar.
-->
